WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.655
A reshape is more reversible when each source value
maps cleanly to one output cell

00:00:04.668 --> 00:00:10.346
and category labels are preserved It becomes lossy
when several rows are

00:00:10.359 --> 00:00:16.149
aggregated into one cell Dropping NULL rows can also
remove missingness

00:00:16.175 --> 00:00:23.553
information Collapsing categories can remove
distinctions Always

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.803
identify which information survives the
transformation
